flowchart LR
  Agent[Agent with its own token] --> GW[Trust Gateway]
  subgraph GWBox[Trust Gateway]
    AU[Token check]
    MF[Manifest pin]
    LB[Data-flow labels]
    PD[OPA decision]
    TX[Downstream token]
    AU --> MF --> LB --> PD --> TX
  end
  GW --> GWBox
  PD <--> OPA[(OPA)]
  PD --> HQ[Approval queue]
  TX --> Mail[Mail server]
  TX --> Repo[Repo server]
  TX --> Web[Web server]
  IdP[Mock OIDC or optional cloud IdP] --> AU
  GW --> OTel[OTel collector] --> Jaeger[Jaeger]
